  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **In the Midnight Hour**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Iko Iko**: back after 45 archived shows (536 days) [4]\n- **Milestones**: rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **NYE Celebrations**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2019-12-31.deadco2019-12-31ChaseCenter** (recommended): audience recording; 25 songs; 218 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer who attended says Bobby's vocals sounded good and John's solos stood out on the recording [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Attendee found the show's overall look and feel striking, with the whole band jamming [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2019-12-31.deadco2019-12-31ChaseCenter**: taped by Bill Zimmerman; transferred by JT/NY; source: Aud > DPA 4011 > GAKable's > MixPre 6 [1]. Also: Transfer from SD card at 24-bit/96kHz, tracked and edited in Sound Forge Pro 10, converted to FLAC with Traders Little Helper [1]",
